  "religion": {
    "_note": "Deity-names are phoneme-morphs of the Agrippan canon through Slavic phonology (family_slavic.json theonym_set) - never real Slavic gods (no Perun/Veles/Svarog/Mokosh/Lada/Morana). Neutral and Chaotic: Neutral clans honor the Dedy (ancestral dead), the rod-spirits and the land-powers; Chaotic war-bands swear by the storm and the wild-hunt powers. The volkhv mediates at the kapishche.",
    "clergy_ladder": {
      "1": "Vedun (diviner-novice)",
      "3": "Zhrets (sacrificer-priest)",
      "5": "Volkhv (priest-sorcerer)",
      "7": "Starshy Volkhv (high priest)",
      "9": "Verhovny Volkhv (supreme priest)"
    },
    "demon_epithet_pattern": "the wild and grasping powers keep their Slavic morphs + a portfolio epithet (distinct per power): Maraxus -> Marakh the War-Fire; Vacidus -> Vakid the Unmaker; Lusanto -> Lusan the Hoard-Serpent.",
