  "titles": {
    "_tiers_note": "Slavic clanhold, ascending. Built on knyaz (prince) and the rod-clans: Knyaz (prince) principality, Velik Knyaz (grand prince) kingdom, Kagan (over-king of many princes) empire over the Kaganat. Boyar (noble) barony; Krainik (border-warden) march; Zhupan (district chief) county; Voevoda (war-leader) duchy. The veche checks the knyaz; a clan culture rarely rises past the knyaz. (Rank titles are the real Slavic register, allowed.)",
